OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start to the day with
OL,6,Fany mist and fog patches slowly
OL,7,Fclearing. Otherwise, dry but somewhat
OL,8,Fcloudier than Monday with spells of
OL,9,Fhazy sunshine. Patchy rain arriving
OL,10,Finto the far south later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudier in the far south
OL,13,Fwith patchy rain through this evening
OL,14,Fand overnight. Colder in the north
OL,15,Fwith clear spells and a rural frost,
OL,16,Fmainly in Cumbria.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
