OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloud and patchy rain to
OL,6,Fthe south initially but turning
OL,7,Fbrighter for all through the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith the odd shower. Colder overnight
OL,9,Fwith a widespread frost.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FLargely dry with plenty of autumnal
OL,13,Fsunshine. Colder, especially in the
OL,14,Fbrisk northerly winds initially with
OL,15,Fovernight frost. Generally cloudier
OL,16,Flate Friday into Saturday with the odd
OL,17,Fshower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
